nt": "[quote][pid=878285001,47288722,711]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66983776]大时代冲冲冲[/uid] (2026-08-13 10:56):[/b]<br/><br/>如果诱多拉起来，下午又要跳水。<br/>反而如果现在砸下去，下午再开始拉，情绪就又起来了？[/quote]<br/>没关系 就是一个震荡的局面  没有很明确的信号之前不用猜。", "lou": 262, "content_length": 57, "reply_to": 878285001, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786589906}, {"pid": 878288954, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 99, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 11:22", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "都在等是不是突破  <br/>目前风险是没有  但是一定不是好买点<br/>做完T就等  等到出结果 然后算下一段是几天的行情  那才是正道", "lou": 263, "content_length": 101, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786591347}, {"pid": 878289360, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 43, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 11:25", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878289143,47288722,716]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=64739456]sujac0203[/uid] (2026-08-13 11:23):[/b]<br/><br/>还是站稳三个15分钟么[/quote]<br/>现在还没到数结构的时候。", "lou": 264, "content_length": 29, "reply_to": 878289143, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786591501}, {"pid": 878289625, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 41, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 11:26", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878289519,47288722,717]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67049140]静佑0224[/uid] (2026-08-13 11:26):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大怎么算几天行情啊[/quote]<br/>用计算器", "lou": 265, "content_length": 13, "reply_to": 878289519, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786591617}, {"pid": 878290138, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 59, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 11:30", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878289598,47288722,717]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67165063]熊猫射手[/uid] (2026-08-13 11:26):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，未来几个月是不是都会是轮动行情了，场内成交量不够，抱团瓦解走不出新主线，只能不断轮动，量化行情[/quote]<br/>先把这个星期做好  然后判断好下一周<br/>看不到未来几个月那么久<br/>外围事件那么多  随时可能转向。", "lou": 266, "content_length": 87, "reply_to": 878289598, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786591828}, {"pid": 878290564, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 104, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 11:33", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "一旦药突破三根乌鸦  那就是第一个低位从反弹到反转的板块<br/>有资格参与下一阶段主线的拼搏。", "lou": 267, "content_length": 82, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786592004}, {"pid": 878293376, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 170, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 11:56", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878292790,47288722,719]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=4980970]消逝的神话[/uid] (2026-08-13 11:51):[/b]<br/><br/>算了，我还是老老实实按自己的思路别动的好<br/>我跟狼大这十来年，亏得第二多的时候，就是因为想强行跟狼大，但是实在是跟不上狼大的节奏，各种挨打 [del]以前是最多，但是7月我头铁，现在只能是第二多了[/del]<br/>老老实实学思路，然后把狼大的思路跟自己的思路结合起来 ，然后去外面自己打野验证思路[del]再然后亏的差不多了在回来找狼大回本[/del]<br/>说不定哪天思路对上了就一飞冲天可以自己出去盖新楼了。[/quote]<br/>我也没办法 <br/>我只给大势又说谜语人  给了ETF买卖点又嫌慢  现在直接展示超短又说跟不上<br/>毕竟是公域 众口难调<br/>所以我只能说我想说啥就说啥了。", "lou": 268, "content_length": 128, "reply_to": 878292790, "14": {"13": 1}, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786593364}, {"pid": 878303575, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 86, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 13:35", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "发呆就好了  没事就来吹水。<br/>看得我力竭了。<br/>早上激情一波后量能就萎缩了   市场停滞的时候没什么搞头", "lou": 269, "content_length": 88, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786599305}, {"pid": 878303940, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 79, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 13:38", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "下午拉到电网电池去了 新能源那块<br/>已经开始无限轮动了  也就是没有任何一个方向能说持续性。大家都是看这里接近4-4第一波高位附近  要震荡一下 再冲击高位  然后至于是不是诱多走4-5还是说有GJD助推一下走个失败5了。", "lou": 270, "content_length": 192, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786599507}, {"pid": 878304270, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 38, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 13:41", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878304053,47288722,726]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67276088]鸡你太太美[/uid] (2026-08-13 13:39):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大喵，JJR板块还有机会涨起来吗，是不是下次是宇树上市了啊[/quote]<br/>看你贪不贪了  如果你目标是3-5个点 那很简单<br/>如果你这里跟我说基本面或者什么大预期<br/>我看不到。", "lou": 271, "content_length": 90, "reply_to": 878304053, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786599705}, {"pid": 878304314, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 37, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 13:42", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878304189,47288722,726]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=64289495]生鱼片是死鱼片wk[/uid] (2026-08-13 13:41):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，这里来说，需要走个失败5才对科技好吧？[s:ac:晕][/quote]<br/>走失败5后面就是主升啊  对什么都能好", "lou": 272, "content_length": 38, "reply_to": 878304189, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786599730}, {"pid": 878304722, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 31, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 13:46", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "电力又有板的了。 可惜我这波没了。实在是轮不过去了。", "lou": 273, "content_length": 50, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786599961}, {"pid": 878305346, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 68, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 13:51", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "这种跳水没什么关系  早上卖的半导体准备又可以买回来了", "lou": 274, "content_length": 50, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786600313}, {"pid": 878305665, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 46, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 13:55", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878305423,47288722,729]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=27036967]滚动的牛奶[/uid] (2026-08-13 13:52):[/b]<br/><br/>什么，才是准备么，我刚刚已经买进去了[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>他不跳啊我怎么买<br/>至少能有吃3-5个点的幅度吧 哪怕是ETF", "lou": 275, "content_length": 55, "reply_to": 878305423, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786600520}, {"pid": 878306574, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 52, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:02", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "加回去了 看看能不能吃个3个点波动吧", "lou": 276, "content_length": 33, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786600973}, {"pid": 878306881, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 48, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:05", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878306685,47288722,731]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=42823755]还是不是云[/uid] (2026-08-13 14:03):[/b]<br/><br/>还能看到1.15吗狼大[/quote]<br/>这里只是吃个小波动而已  目标不会变的。除非出现什么意外。<br/>一次能吃几个点  多吃几次  钱不就回来了。", "lou": 277, "content_length": 95, "reply_to": 878306685, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786601110}, {"pid": 878307752, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 31, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:12", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878307566,47288722,733]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=61619324]黄昏叙事诗[/uid] (2026-08-13 14:11):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，贵金属可以埋伏一手吗，今天有色没轮到好像？[s:ac:羡慕][/quote]<br/>有色的股票吗？我不做的<br/>不过按这种轮动的话  尾盘或者明天可能有个买点吧<br/>贵金属 金属那种有色。", "lou": 278, "content_length": 91, "reply_to": 878307566, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786601563}, {"pid": 878308135, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 30, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:16", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878307852,47288722,734]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67223655]加速道减速[/uid] (2026-08-13 14:13):[/b]<br/><br/>不博弈短期的话，休息等下一波也没事吧[/quote]<br/>就看你们能不能忍住了<br/>这里反正就是个反弹", "lou": 279, "content_length": 43, 